{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42788","headline":"中春登楼 一 · 刘兼","name":"中春登楼 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金杯不以涤愁肠，江郡芳时忆故乡。\n两岸烟花春富贵，一楼风月夜凄凉。\n王章莫耻牛衣泪，潘岳休惊鹤鬓霜。\n归去莲花归未得，白云深处有茅堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}